    description: ""  # 6166
    fields:  # 6166
      statement: "The markdown analyzer creates external_symbol nodes for relative documentation links (e.g., adr/0007-...md, ../audits/0005-...md) but emits no edges referencing them. 102 of 105 orphan <external> nodes are markdown:doc_link with zero inbound and zero outbound edges. Same target via different relative paths (adr/0003-...md, docs/adr/0003-...md, 0003-...md) creates duplicate nodes — no path canonicalization."  # 6166
      root_cause: "Markdown analyzer's doc_link emission and the markdown-link-resolver linker are decoupled — nodes get created but no link edges are emitted, so doc references aren't graph-navigable."  # 6166
